    {
      "id": "fetch-stream-object-delta-same-group",
      "description": "fetch stream where the second object carries an Object ID Delta but no Group ID Delta (flags 0x04). Section 11.4.4.1: \"When the Group ID Delta field is not present, the Object ID is the prior Object's ID plus the Object ID Delta if present\" — so this is prior + delta (0 + 4 = 4), not the delta itself, and not prior + delta + 1. The Group ID Delta present case one row above resolves Object ID differently, which is what makes this pair worth having: a decoder that reads Object ID Delta the same way in both branches passes one and fails the other",
      "hex": "05041c03008001aa040401bb",
