    {
      "id": "fetch-stream-new-group-object-id-continues",
      "description": "fetch stream where the second object starts a new group via Group ID Delta but carries no Object ID Delta (flags 0x08). Section 11.4.4.1: \"If Object ID Delta is not present, the Object ID is the prior Object's ID plus one, regardless of which group it belongs to.\" So the Object ID continues 7 → 8 across the group boundary rather than restarting at 0, which is the reading a decoder is most likely to get wrong. Ascending order, so the Group ID is prior + delta + 1 = 1",
